GitLab CI Monitor
=================

This extension is inspired by and derived from "gitlab-pipelines" by jameswain:
    https://github.com/Jameswain/gitlab-pipelines
which is licensed under the ISC License.

Notable changes and additions in this project:
  - Multi-root workspace support (repo -> pipelines -> jobs grouping); every
    workspace folder that is a git repo with a .gitlab-ci.yml is watched,
    instead of only the first folder.
  - Views in both the Explorer and the Source Control panels.
  - Status bar indicator for the active repo/branch pipeline.
  - Desktop notifications when a watched pipeline fails.
  - Retry / cancel pipelines, open pipelines and jobs in GitLab, view job logs.
  - Optional GITLAB_TOKEN environment-variable fallback for the token.
  - HTTP layer rewritten on Node's built-in `https` (no runtime dependencies);
    the insecure `curl --insecure` TLS-bypass fallback was removed.
